<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Experimental Details</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Our implementation is based on Huggingface’s TRL library <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib32" title="" class="ltx_ref">von Werra et al., 2020</a>)</cite>. We list the hyperparameters used in Table <a href="#A1.T5" title="Table 5 ‣ Appendix A Experimental Details ‣ RAPID: An Efficient Reinforcement Learning Algorithm for Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> for SFT, in Table <a href="#A1.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ Appendix A Experimental Details ‣ RAPID: An Efficient Reinforcement Learning Algorithm for Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> for RL algorithms. We also include our package versions (Table <a href="#A1.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ Appendix A Experimental Details ‣ RAPID: An Efficient Reinforcement Learning Algorithm for Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a>) and DeepSpeed configuration <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib23" title="" class="ltx_ref">Rajbhandari et al., 2020</a>)</cite> (Figure <a href="#A1.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ Appendix A Experimental Details ‣ RAPID: An Efficient Reinforcement Learning Algorithm for Small Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>) for full reproducibility.</p>
</div>
